                                                "example_id": "7468ff33-cfe1-4fee-ba36-6e91de82e085",
                                                "sense_id": "aa493ec8-b091-3aaa-9993-8efc4b514b3a",
                                                "text": "Enter Nobody, and the Clowne. / Nobody. Ahem boy, Nobody is ſound yet for all his troubles."
